## One .gitignore for the repository. Patterns without a leading or middle slash match at any depth.

## Claude Code: local to each machine (skills, settings, references)
.claude/

## Docs: local plans, specs and notes
docs/

## Environment variables and secrets: real values live only in the ignored .env files
## (see Leyeco2Dashboard.App/.env.example)
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example
secrets.json
appsettings.*.Development.json
appsettings.Local.json

## .NET / Visual Studio: user-specific files
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs
*.DotSettings.user

